{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06853","headline":"闺怨 · 王昌龄","name":"闺怨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闺中少妇不曾愁，春日凝妆上翠楼。\n忽见陌头杨柳色，悔教夫壻觅封侯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王昌龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06853.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06853","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言绝句","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、《全唐诗》卷一四三、《唐诗鉴赏辞典》王昌龄条（上海辞书出版社，1983）、《全唐诗》（清·曹寅等编，康熙扬州诗局本）","citation":"周啸天"}